<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Colgate Palmolive Company &amp; Anr. v. Haleon Plc &amp; Anr., CCP(O) 66/2026 in CS(COMM) 288/2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Court</th><td>High Court of Delhi, Justice Tejas Karia</td></tr>
